[I] Protocol adapter to run UCI chess engines under XBoard

[T] PolyGlot is a WinBoard/XBoard protocol to UCI protocol adapter, allowing
[T] UCI chess engines to be used with XBoard compatible interfaces. It also
[T] acts as an opening book engine and provides utilities for creating and
[T] analyzing opening books and EPD files.

[U] https://www.chessprogramming.org/PolyGlot

[A] Polyglot Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

